From 12185329aaa2f0778e91e35c28436742bda398c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 06:21:44 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix: carry refusal names the setup's actual machine kind

The refusal said 'a lathe or mill-turn machine' for any non-mill setup,
including a sinker EDM. carry_machine_refusal(kind) keeps the strict
refusal and the stable CARRY_MACHINE_REFUSAL prefix, naming the kind.

Fixes #1182

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
